note PLANNED — Romit UI framework (Stage 4). Not parsed by the Stage 1 compiler.
note Minimal counter: theme lives on the app; the "+" button has no extra styling.

app CounterDemo
  home Counter
  theme default
    accent #2563eb
    button
      background accent
      text white
      radius 8
  defaults
    padding 24
    align center

  screen Counter at /
    state
      count int is 0
    column
      gap 16
      text count
        size 48
      button "+"
        on click increment
    on click increment
      set count to count plus 1
